  "text": "Your face is constructed to move organically and show your emotions, making you more relatable to organic creatures. You become trained in Diplomacy. If you are already trained in Diplomacy, you instead become trained in a skill of your choice. Additionally, you gain the Glad-Hand skill feat, even if you do not meet its prerequisites.\n\nEnhancement You are particularly skilled at pouring your heart out to others. You gain the Plaintive Plea action.",
